 will take you on a tour of the agricultural terraces, temples, and impressive irrigation system\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Buffet lunch at a local restaurant\",\"description\":\"included in the price), where you can enjoy the delicious flavors of Peruvian cuisine, combining traditional recipes with fresh local ingredients\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Journey to Ollantaytambo\",\"description\":\"a living Inca town that preserves its original urban layout. Here we will visit the impressive Ollantaytambo Fortress, an archaeological complex that showcases Inca urban planning and offers panoramic views of the valley\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"We continue our journey to Chinchero\",\"description\":\"a village renowned for its alpaca and llama textile production. Here we will visit a weaving center where we\'ll learn about the textile-making process and have the opportunity to watch artisans at work\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Return to Cusco\",\"description\":\"enjoying the landscapes of the Sacred Valley along the way back\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Arrival in Cusco and transfer back to\",\"description\":\"Arrival in Cusco and transfer back to your hotel, concluding our day full of discoveries in the Sacred Valley, Ollantaytambo, and Chinchero.\"}}]},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":75,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://www.limaviewtours.com/en/tours/detalle/valle-sagrado-de-los-incas\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-09-01\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-11-07\"}}' WHERE slug='valle-sagrado-de-los-incas';
